# Copy to .env and fill in — the CLI auto-loads it (no export needed) and this
# file takes precedence over the ambient environment, so the API key and its
# matching base URL below always stay paired.
# Required only for the agentic workflow (`barndsl design ...` / the serve agent pane).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Leave blank for native Anthropic (https://api.anthropic.com). Set it to point
# the agent at a custom endpoint — a proxy, gateway, or self-hosted
# Anthropic-compatible API — e.g. https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic for DeepSeek.
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
# Optional model override for the agent (CLI `design` and the playground). For
# DeepSeek's Anthropic-compatible endpoint, prefer BARNDSL_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# for everyday drafts or BARNDSL_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro for harder design work.
BARNDSL_MODEL=
# Optional per-call output-token cap (default 32000). It bounds thinking + reply,
# so a reasoning model like deepseek-v4-pro needs generous headroom or it spends
# the whole budget thinking and returns nothing. Raise for heavier reasoners.
BARNDSL_MAX_TOKENS=
# Optional default number of refine rounds the agent runs (default 3). More rounds
# = more chances to converge, at more cost; fewer = faster and cheaper. The CLI
# `--iterations` flag and the playground's per-request value override it (the
# playground clamps to 1..8).
BARNDSL_MAX_ITERATIONS=
# Optional design-score gate 0-100 (default 90). The loop keeps iterating while
# the score is below this. Lower it for a quicker "good enough" run; 0 disables
# the gate. The CLI `--target-score` flag overrides it.
BARNDSL_TARGET_SCORE=
# Optional model-critic cadence: each_round (default), final, or never. `final`
# lets the compiler and score drive revisions, then asks the critic when a
# candidate looks finishable or the iteration cap is reached.
BARNDSL_CRITIQUE=
# Optional rendered-PNG critique: auto (default), on, or off. `auto` disables
# image blocks for endpoints that do not support them, including DeepSeek's
# Anthropic-compatible API.
BARNDSL_CRITIQUE_VISION=
